Package: agentomicsCore
Type: Package
Title: Infrastructure for Human-in-the-Loop Bioinformatics Pipelines
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Changhao", family = "Kan",
                  email = "kch_ynu@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Experimental R-side infrastructure for building
    human-in-the-loop, provenance-tracked bioinformatics workflows.
    Provides an S4 container (AgentOmics) that stores decision records,
    generated script snippets, figures, parameters, and an arbitrary data
    payload. Includes Anthropic and OpenAI-compatible chat-function
    factories, best-effort token-usage capture when providers return usage
    metadata, structured text and function-call turns with explicit conversation
    state, an extensible HTML report renderer, and checkpoint I/O.
    Designed for downstream domain packages such as scAgentKit.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
